<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raised no money at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raised no money at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian treasury raised no money at its weekly auction of treasury bills on Tuesday February 11, and repaid maturing paper totalling 33.2 million dinars.</p>
<p>The treasury said banks bid for 454 million dinars of 13-, 26-, 52-week and two-year paper at between 7.0625 and 7.5000 percent. ($=1.06 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
